        "Description": "Start in the washing room with the hotel employee suit,get the axe and throw it on seperated guy then lure the Woman to the Body and throw the axe on the guy and at then at the wman.Then lure the guy outside in the room(watch out he is not discovering any of the bodies)and throw the axe at him.Lastly lure someone in the room so all bodies get discoverd,i recommend hiding in a locker until all bodies are found.Then just go to the exit in the Basement,there is a camera between the room and stairs!",
